# Studio documentation standards

- Read `studio/CONTEXT.md` first every session
- No phase gate passes without CONTEXT.md update + relevant docs committed
- Every locked decision gets an ADR in `studio/docs/decisions/`
- Grilling Q&A append to `studio/docs/discovery/grilling-log.md` only
- Track all work in GitHub Issues; Producer maintains Project board
- Playtest feedback uses templates in `studio/docs/playtesting/checklists/`
